# Copy to .dev.vars for local Astro/Wrangler development.
# NEVER commit the real file — .gitignore excludes it and CI scans for leaks.

# ── Required ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Shared secret between the GitHub Actions pulse agents and the ingest API.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Must match the value set via:
#   wrangler pages secret put PROXY_SECRET --project-name skills-hub
#   gh secret set PROXY_SECRET --repo cyalcala/skills-hub
PROXY_SECRET=dev-only-not-a-real-secret

# ── Optional ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GitHub token for the harvester. Unauthenticated is 60 req/h and code search
# requires a token; authenticated is 5000 req/h. Needs public read scope only.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Public site identity, also set in wrangler.jsonc vars.
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:4321
PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Skills Hub

# ── Notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# There is deliberately NO AI provider key here. Enrichment is deterministic by
# design (ADR-002); the optional AI pass uses a Cloudflare Workers AI binding
# configured in wrangler.jsonc, not an API key in the environment. The pipeline
# must run correctly with no model available at all.
#
# The D1 database id is NOT a secret and lives in apps/web/wrangler.jsonc.
